Touching this file starts .github/workflows/settlement-history.yml. The workflow
is branch-local and GitHub offers workflow_dispatch only for workflows on the
default branch, so a gated push trigger is how it gets started.

One directive is read, anchored at both ends so this prose cannot be mistaken
for it. The stage word is the word probe or the word harvest, on its own line.

STAGE=probe

REQUEST=1
